{"id":"faiblesse","lemma":"faiblesse","pos":"noun","rank":2749,"glosses":["weakness"],"ipa":"/fɛ.blɛs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ee/Fr-faiblesse.ogg/Fr-faiblesse.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"faiblesses"},"formAudio":{"faiblesses":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-faiblesses.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est une de mes faiblesses.","en":"That's one of my weaknesses.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Vous tirez avantage de sa faiblesse.","en":"You're taking advantage of her weakness.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to draw, drag, pull","l":"tirer"},{"g":"advantage"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"J'ai senti une faiblesse dans les genoux.","en":"I felt weak in the knees.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to smell","l":"sentir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"knee","l":"genou"}]},{"text":"Tout le monde a ses forces et ses faiblesses.","en":"Everyone has strengths and weaknesses.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"force","l":"force"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"his"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"everyone, everybody"]]},{"text":"Quelles sont les forces et les faiblesses de l'entreprise ?","en":"What are the company's strengths and weaknesses?","words":[{"g":"which","l":"quel"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"force","l":"force"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"company, business"}]}]}